WEBVTT

NOTE
Leviathan - Tsunami. Sea dragon summon.
Observed duration in reference video: ~42 seconds.

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
Leviathan. Tsunami.

00:02.500 --> 00:08.000
The battlefield floods. Water rushes in from every side.

00:08.000 --> 00:15.000
Leviathan rises — a vast blue serpent dragon, scales gleaming, jaws agape.

00:15.000 --> 00:22.000
He coils high above the enemies, rears back, and roars at the sky.

00:22.000 --> 00:30.000
A towering wall of water rises behind him, blotting out the horizon.

00:30.000 --> 00:38.000
The wave crashes down on the enemies in a churning tsunami.

00:38.000 --> 00:43.000
The water recedes; Leviathan dives back into the depths.
